{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Glossary.GlossaryCategoricalQTorsionLeaf","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Glossary.GlossaryCategoricalQTorsionLeaf","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Subobject.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Subobject.Limits","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Limits.Shapes.Pullback.HasPullback"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.flow_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.flow_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.lean#L51-L51","doc":"**Flow invariance**: the q-Reeb flow preserves the leaf, stated as\n`φ^*(L) = L` on sub-objects. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.horizontal","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.lean#L48-L48","doc":"**Horizontality**: the leaf lies in the kernel of the vertical\nprojection — its arrow composed with `π_V` is zero.\n\nWas `horizontal : Prop`, a field typed with the universe `Prop`, so the\ninstance chose the condition and `True` discharged it. The docstring\nsaid the projection is \"part of the ambient q-connection data\"; `piV`\nis now a parameter, which is what that sentence means in a type. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.leaf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.leaf","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The sub-object representing the leaf. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf","kind":"structure","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.lean#L26-L51","doc":"A `CategoricalQTorsionLeaf` packages the data of a maximal\nsub-object that is both horizontal (in the kernel of the vertical\nprojection) and invariant under the q-Reeb flow.\n\nIn Mathlib terms this is a sub-object equipped with two witnesses:\nhorizontality and flow-invariance. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:rem:glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf","label":"rem:glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf","md":"quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}